{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The smart plug feels like a useful next purchase because it would let my existing Echo devices control a lamp, adding something I cannot already do with them.",
    "The larger Echo Show and HDMI cable connect to my home electronics interests, although I would need a reason to add another display or a ten-foot cable before buying."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The older Echo devices and additional Fire TV sticks repeat functions covered by my recently purchased Show 5, fourth-generation Dot, and Fire TV Stick 4K Max bundle.",
    "Buying external storage does not mean I need an internal SSD; I have no current upgrade project or confirmed compatibility. The tablet likewise does not meet a need I have identified."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My recent Amazon device purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to recommend more Amazon devices, even when they would duplicate what I already have.",
    "My computer and home electronics purchases seem to have been treated as broad interest in related hardware without enough attention to what each purchase would help me do."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent device purchases and the Show 5 stand suggest I am still using and completing those setups, so compatible additions feel more useful than older replacements.",
    "My history includes accessories for particular devices, such as Harmony replacement batteries. A clear connection to something I own matters more than a general resemblance to past purchases."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in connected home electronics but miss that I currently value useful additions to my existing setup more than duplicate devices."
}"}
